            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Elimina duplicados de la lista <code>temperatures</code> transformándola en un conjunto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(set(temperatures))\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"58\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{17.5, 18, 17}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>set(temperatures)</code>.</p></body></html>"
