            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra esto en la consola?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"soccer = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Yumi&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Diya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tennis = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Yumi&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"all_friends = soccer.union(tennis)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(all_friends)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{'Lily', 'Ann', 'Yumi', 'Diya'}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>{'Lily', 'Ann', 'Yumi', 'Diya'}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>{'Lily', 'Ann', 'Ann', 'Yumi', 'Yumi', 'Diya'}</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>{'Lily', 'Diya'}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>{'Lily', 'Ann', 'Yumi', 'Diya'}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuántos valores contiene <code>all_friends</code> después de la unión?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"soccer = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Yumi&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Diya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tennis = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Yumi&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"all_friends = soccer.union(tennis)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(all_friends)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{'Lily', 'Ann', 'Yumi', 'Diya'}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Cuatro, porque los nombres compartidos aparecen solo una vez en la unión</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Seis, porque la unión conserva ambas copias de los nombres compartidos</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Dos, porque la unión conserva solo los nombres compartidos por ambos conjuntos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Cuatro, porque los nombres compartidos aparecen solo una vez en la unión.</p></body></html>"
